Changelog – Lihle's Salon Website

All  changes to the Lihle's Salon website are documented in this file.

Added

 Created the basic HTML structure for the website.
 Added a header displaying the salon name and slogan.
 Created a navigation menu for Home, About Us, Services, Gallery, and Contact pages.
 Added the main content area and footer.
 Created an About Us section with the salon's mission, vision, and values.
 Added a Services page featuring hair styling, nail services, makeup, and bridal services.
 Added service descriptions and example prices.
 Created a booking form for appointment requests.
 Added form fields for customer name, email, phone number, service, date, time, and additional information.
 Added client-side validation using HTML5 and JavaScript.
 Added CSS styling for colours, typography, buttons, and service cards.
 Added background image styling for the About Us section.
 Added hover effects to navigation links and service cards.
 Added responsive CSS rules to improve the layout on mobile devices and desktop screens.
 Created a README file describing the project, technologies, features, and setup instructions.

Changed

 Improved the website's appearance using a soft pink, white, and brown colour palette.
 Updated the Services page layout to display services in attractive cards.
 Improved image sizing and positioning using CSS.
 Adjusted spacing, borders, and button styles to create a consistent design.

Improved

 Made navigation clearer and easier to use.
 Improved readability through consistent fonts, colours, and spacing.
 Added validation messages to help customers complete the booking form correctly.
 Improved the website layout for different screen sizes.

Known Limitations

 Booking requests are not yet stored in a database.
 Contact form submissions are not yet connected to an email service or backend.
 Example service prices must be confirmed and updated to match the salon's actual prices.
 Gallery images and contact details should be updated with the salon's real information.

Future Updates

Planned
 Add booking confirmation notifications.
 Complete and test the Gallery and Contact pages.
 Add customer reviews and testimonials.

